# Packaging print masters. Git tracks the GENERATORS and the notes only.
# The PDFs, natives, TIFFs and fonts are large binaries made once; they live in Drive
# (as-printed V1 already there; _working-2026-09 to follow). Never in git.
*
!.gitignore
!*.md
!_generators/
!_generators/**
_generators/**/__pycache__/
_generators/**/*.pyc
